 ],
 "notes": [
  "LHM++ (LHMPP-700M-PixelShuffle, CC BY-NC 4.0 weights) avatars of John and Lula (take john_lula) from 8 crops of the one phone video (lhmpp_video8), those + the photo crop (lhmpp_video8_photo; diagnostic lhmpp_video8_photofull with John's whole occluded photo mask), posed with the john_lula MAMMA fit and rendered into held-out phone frames, a turntable and two 4 s clips (both dancers together); weights stay on the pod; crops and frames go to our own pod only (owner consent 2026-10-19)"
 ]
}